    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >India \u201989 is a story based cooking game, where you are a 10 year old from the UK experiencing  a small village in India in 1989.  You cook various dishes as a street food vendor in different locations. Explore the joy of village life, family and cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/6991176b5eb8bfa450fc639ceb7e9127.poster.avif?t=1739219438\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/6991176b5eb8bfa450fc639ceb7e9127.webm?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/6991176b5eb8bfa450fc639ceb7e9127.mp4?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore village life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click your way round a village, talk to people and uncover the story as you complete various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/23114684034fd43f105c81a006d5ef8d.poster.avif?t=1739219438\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/23114684034fd43f105c81a006d5ef8d.webm?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/23114684034fd43f105c81a006d5ef8d.mp4?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the culture and life in a small village in Gujarat, through various recipes you learn from different characters unlocking travel to new places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/7f1b785025318faf1a509569b1985384.poster.avif?t=1739219438\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/7f1b785025318faf1a509569b1985384.webm?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/7f1b785025318faf1a509569b1985384.mp4?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A holiday to remember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to a cosy world where you experience new places, people and the power of family!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/d7646a7589d20dd027e401ed69b60d2e.poster.avif?t=1739219438\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/d7646a7589d20dd027e401ed69b60d2e.webm?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437160/extras/d7646a7589d20dd027e401ed69b60d2e.mp4?t=1739219438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
